                                        "sense_id": "35b04811-f145-310b-986d-cd81affc052b",
                                        "entry_id": "64f707d2-b360-3763-8879-cc31e8439e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A result that one is attempting to achieve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2d5192c-8411-4993-9688-2adce62b12a0",
                                                "sense_id": "35b04811-f145-310b-986d-cd81affc052b",
                                                "text": "My lifelong goal is to get into a Hollywood movie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3ddce64-3d43-48f7-b834-63c000ef854f",
                                                "sense_id": "35b04811-f145-310b-986d-cd81affc052b",
                                                "text": "His goal is to become a Youtuber."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77e48028-93e7-4e70-91ff-c8019053d37f",
                                                "sense_id": "35b04811-f145-310b-986d-cd81affc052b",
                                                "text": "She failed in her goal to become captain of the team."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cafddc2-01b1-41ea-a0e6-fa5fe1e98706",
                                                "sense_id": "35b04811-f145-310b-986d-cd81affc052b",
                                                "text": "The goal should be to strengthen workers without hamstringing firms. Growth, rather than employment protection, is the priority. More work means a stronger labour market, which would bid up employees’ slice, as it did in America in the 1990s when unemployment was at record lows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                        "entry_id": "64f707d2-b360-3763-8879-cc31e8439e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In many sports, an area into which the players attempt to put an object."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aaf232aa-99fe-42cd-9900-a3b1733f6e8f",
                                                "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                                "text": "The racers are approaching the goal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc088c2c-7c6e-42ea-a373-c4df54837c7b",
                                                "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                                "text": "fans behind the goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d9c009-95f4-4bd4-9c29-426b96090d68",
                                                "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                                "text": "play in goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70c2a66c-3fd0-4eea-9f4e-6b9af8f89b73",
                                                "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                                "text": "The ball rolled slowly into the goal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a15a0c21-04d2-4050-9f67-e92aad8ded74",
                                                "sense_id": "7d1bfff0-bd5b-3ed0-9b5e-95a21ed6359f",
                                                "text": "He hit the goal 20 yards away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94bca8d8-d26b-30dd-83bd-8f53479961aa",
                                        "entry_id": "64f707d2-b360-3763-8879-cc31e8439e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of placing the object into the goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50c01fd2-6c38-4f0a-9a11-50e0721148fe",
                                                "sense_id": "94bca8d8-d26b-30dd-83bd-8f53479961aa",
                                                "text": "miss a goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5257f9f3-ce43-402d-984c-92d1d6e4a2eb",
                                                "sense_id": "94bca8d8-d26b-30dd-83bd-8f53479961aa",
                                                "text": "concede a goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebdb0e7a-5fa2-4950-a2f8-67f01e60896d",
                                                "sense_id": "94bca8d8-d26b-30dd-83bd-8f53479961aa",
                                                "text": "let in a goal"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "890aef09-8ac4-35ae-bbdd-e93f95ddc4cc",
                                        "entry_id": "64f707d2-b360-3763-8879-cc31e8439e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A point scored in a game as a result of placing the object into the goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7770f24-aa99-4476-9775-5a840edff101",
                                                "sense_id": "890aef09-8ac4-35ae-bbdd-e93f95ddc4cc",
                                                "text": "score a goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4dd1829-eb30-421f-841c-d357b71f1f84",
                                                "sense_id": "890aef09-8ac4-35ae-bbdd-e93f95ddc4cc",
                                                "text": "The former Forest man, who passed a late fitness test, appeared to use Guy Moussi for leverage before nodding in David Fox's free-kick at the far post - his 22nd goal of the season."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "421c9e20-8672-38af-93b9-56331c498e7a",
                                        "entry_id": "64f707d2-b360-3763-8879-cc31e8439e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A noun or noun phrase that receives the action of a verb. The subject of a passive verb or the direct object of an active verb. Also called a patient, target, or undergoer."
                                        ],
